    <h2 id="data-flow">Data Flow — call_llm Pipeline</h2>
    <p>The <code>call_llm()</code> function is the most critical utility — every agent uses it to invoke the LLM. It handles model instantiation, structured output, retry logic, JSON extraction, and error recovery with default factories.</p>
    <div class="mermaid-wrapper" onclick="openOverlay(this)">
      <pre class="mermaid" data-source="sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant CallLLM as utils.llm.call_llm
    participant GetModel as llm.models.get_model
    participant LLM as LangChain Model
    Agent->>CallLLM: call_llm(prompt, model_name, provider, pydantic_model)
    CallLLM->>GetModel: get_model(model_name, provider)
    GetModel-->>CallLLM: chat_model
    loop max_retries=3
        CallLLM->>LLM: invoke(prompt, json_mode=True)
        alt Success
            LLM-->>CallLLM: JSON response
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: Parse with pydantic_model
            CallLLM-->>Agent: Typed result
        else Parse Error
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: extract_json_from_response()
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: Retry
        else LLM Error
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: default_factory fallback
            CallLLM-->>Agent: Default result
        end
    end">sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant CallLLM as utils.llm.call_llm
    participant GetModel as llm.models.get_model
    participant LLM as LangChain Model
    Agent->>CallLLM: call_llm(prompt, model_name, provider, pydantic_model)
    CallLLM->>GetModel: get_model(model_name, provider)
    GetModel-->>CallLLM: chat_model
    loop max_retries=3
        CallLLM->>LLM: invoke(prompt, json_mode=True)
        alt Success
            LLM-->>CallLLM: JSON response
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: Parse with pydantic_model
            CallLLM-->>Agent: Typed result
        else Parse Error
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: extract_json_from_response()
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: Retry
        else LLM Error
            CallLLM->>CallLLM: default_factory fallback
            CallLLM-->>Agent: Default result
        end
    end</pre>
    </div>

